// original: Added missing bodies to M3/M4/M6 (VDD) and M5/M8 (ground). All eight MOSFETs are now four-terminal. Joined tail and bias as the user confirmed; M1/M2 bodies remain connected to that common source node. This unusual tail/bias connection is intentional image matching, not a claim of good amplifier performance.
